WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.307 --> 00:00:02.974
(fanfare music)

00:00:07.401 --> 00:00:08.497
- [Voiceover] Hi and welcome.

00:00:08.497 --> 00:00:10.139
I am Hammeh and in this new video series,

00:00:10.139 --> 00:00:11.984
I'll be walking you
through fun extra facts

00:00:11.984 --> 00:00:13.738
and potential backstory behind the heroes

00:00:13.738 --> 00:00:15.363
in Overwatch that we discover

00:00:15.363 --> 00:00:17.562
through their in-game voice lines.

00:00:17.562 --> 00:00:20.205
Before any map starts during
the game on various triggers,

00:00:20.205 --> 00:00:22.512
Overwatch heroes chat with
and react to each other

00:00:22.512 --> 00:00:24.500
in some funny in-game voice interactions.

00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:26.658
These give us some great
insights into hero character,

00:00:26.658 --> 00:00:29.450
interesting back stories,
and even some things

00:00:29.450 --> 00:00:31.504
in the story that haven't
been shown in the game yet.

00:00:31.504 --> 00:00:34.035
In this video, we're
looking at Genji's story

00:00:34.035 --> 00:00:35.486
through his interactions
with fellow heroes

00:00:35.486 --> 00:00:37.399
and the world around him.

00:00:37.399 --> 00:00:39.015
The ex-Overwatch agent has found peace

00:00:39.015 --> 00:00:40.873
with his new existence as a Cyborg.

00:00:40.873 --> 00:00:42.523
Although he still has issues to settle

00:00:42.523 --> 00:00:43.856
with his brother Hanzo,

00:00:43.856 --> 00:00:45.459
the circumstances around their parting,

00:00:45.459 --> 00:00:47.229
and their family's criminal past.

00:00:47.229 --> 00:00:49.028
Even though he's been
through some great trials

00:00:49.028 --> 00:00:51.525
in his life, we can see
that Genji still has time

00:00:51.525 --> 00:00:53.903
for a bit of humor and wisdom as well.

00:00:53.903 --> 00:00:55.331
From some of his voice lines, we can see

00:00:55.331 --> 00:00:57.432
that Zenyatta's benevolent
wisdom and tutorship

00:00:57.432 --> 00:00:58.791
has rubbed off a bit on Genji.

00:00:58.791 --> 00:01:01.739
- Revenge takes only the one who seeks it.

00:01:01.739 --> 00:01:03.902
- [Voiceover] And Genji
still got a sense of humor.

00:01:03.902 --> 00:01:05.354
Here's one line he can come out with.

00:01:05.354 --> 00:01:09.265
- My name is green cyborg ninja dude.

00:01:09.265 --> 00:01:10.739
That was actually mentioned on Twitter

00:01:10.739 --> 00:01:13.235
by Senior Game Designer
and story guru Michael Chu

00:01:13.235 --> 00:01:15.302
from the Overwatch team
when Genji was announced.

00:01:15.302 --> 00:01:16.776
A lot of community saw Genji in the art

00:01:16.776 --> 00:01:18.994
and all of his phrases
were quite commonly used

00:01:18.994 --> 00:01:20.259
in trying to describe him.

00:01:20.259 --> 00:01:23.615
"Green cyborg ninja dude"
when he didn't have a name.

00:01:23.615 --> 00:01:24.787
Although this is kind of said as a joke,

00:01:24.787 --> 00:01:26.006
we're a little bit sad that Genji

00:01:26.006 --> 00:01:28.177
can't enjoy one of his
favorite foods anymore.

00:01:28.177 --> 00:01:29.722
Even though he seems to
see some humor in it.

00:01:29.722 --> 00:01:34.641
- [Genji] Ramen! (sighs) It's
just not the same anymore.

00:01:34.641 --> 00:01:36.548
- [Voiceover] If you've read
the bios of the Overwatch cast,

00:01:36.548 --> 00:01:38.764
then you know that Genji
and Hanzo have a shared

00:01:38.764 --> 00:01:40.273
and troubled family history.

00:01:40.273 --> 00:01:43.350
Both sons of the Shimada Clan,
Hanzo took a path of duty

00:01:43.350 --> 00:01:44.778
where Genji showed little interest

00:01:44.778 --> 00:01:46.426
in the family criminal business.

00:01:46.426 --> 00:01:48.040
Following the untimely
death of their father,

00:01:48.040 --> 00:01:49.503
tensions mounted between the two

00:01:49.503 --> 00:01:52.243
until a violent confrontation
ended in Hanzo leaving Genji

00:01:52.243 --> 00:01:53.578
on the verge of death.

00:01:53.578 --> 00:01:54.901
The two have a number of interactions.

00:01:54.901 --> 00:01:56.626
We'll show some of the
Genji led ones here.

00:01:56.626 --> 00:01:58.202
We're led to believe to start with

00:01:58.202 --> 00:02:00.733
that the two haven't seen each
other since that fateful day

00:02:00.733 --> 00:02:02.033
from this conversation.

00:02:02.033 --> 00:02:05.911
- What's wrong Hanzo?
Don't you recognize me?

00:02:05.911 --> 00:02:08.221
- You may call yourself my brother,

00:02:08.221 --> 00:02:10.984
but you are not the Genji I knew.

00:02:10.984 --> 00:02:12.445
- [Voiceover] Since
leaving Genji for dead,

00:02:12.445 --> 00:02:15.187
Hanzo's remorse caused
him to reject his duty

00:02:15.187 --> 00:02:16.488
of ruling the Shimada.

00:02:16.488 --> 00:02:18.879
Instead, he wandered the
world in search of redemption

00:02:18.879 --> 00:02:21.794
and tried to find ways
to reclaim his honor.

00:02:21.794 --> 00:02:22.978
Genji would actually comment

00:02:22.978 --> 00:02:24.847
on his brother's fall from
grace when he sees him.

00:02:24.847 --> 00:02:28.605
- So this is what has become of you...

00:02:28.605 --> 00:02:29.955
A pity.

00:02:29.955 --> 00:02:31.459
- [Voiceover] In spite of
what they've been through,

00:02:31.459 --> 00:02:34.552
Genji still wishes for his own
brother to find a new path.

00:02:34.552 --> 00:02:36.352
Perhaps he's forgiven him
for what he's done to him.

00:02:36.352 --> 00:02:39.278
- It is not too late to
change your course, brother.

00:02:39.278 --> 00:02:43.353
- You are mistaken, brother.
I am beyond redemption.

00:02:43.353 --> 00:02:47.265
We could have built an empire together.

00:02:47.265 --> 00:02:49.932
- That was your dream. Not mine.

00:02:51.109 --> 00:02:52.699
- [Voiceover] An element
of brotherly rivalry

00:02:52.699 --> 00:02:54.603
still remains though,
when Genji gets a kill

00:02:54.603 --> 00:02:56.728
on an enemy Hanzo, you can
still hear this come out.

00:02:56.728 --> 00:02:59.228
- I am victorious this time, brother.

00:02:59.228 --> 00:03:02.050
I learned that from my brother.

00:03:02.050 --> 00:03:02.883
- [Voiceover] Another character that Genji

00:03:02.883 --> 00:03:06.613
has a deep history with, is
the omnic monk, Zenyatta.

00:03:06.613 --> 00:03:08.389
After working with Overwatch to dismantle

00:03:08.389 --> 00:03:11.233
his family's criminal empire,
Genji couldn't come to terms

00:03:11.233 --> 00:03:13.358
with his new cyborg form and nature.

00:03:13.358 --> 00:03:15.216
He roamed the world to
try and find meaning

00:03:15.216 --> 00:03:17.363
before coming across Zenyatta.

00:03:17.363 --> 00:03:19.020
He initially rejected his wisdom,

00:03:19.020 --> 00:03:21.833
but then, Zenyatta
eventually became his mentor

00:03:21.833 --> 00:03:23.412
and his guru of sorts helped him

00:03:23.412 --> 00:03:27.240
to accept his dual existence
as both being man and machine.

00:03:27.240 --> 00:03:29.890
The pupil-master relationship
and deep bond between the two

00:03:29.890 --> 00:03:31.411
is evident in a lot of their lines.

00:03:31.411 --> 00:03:33.432
Here's a mention that
Zenyatta throws to Genji.

00:03:33.432 --> 00:03:38.122
- It is good to fight alongside
one of my brightest pupils.

00:03:38.122 --> 00:03:39.705
- [Voiceover] When Genji kills
Zenyatta on another team,

00:03:39.705 --> 00:03:41.512
he likes to take a little dig at Zenyatta

00:03:41.512 --> 00:03:44.106
in a "apprentice has become the
master" kind of fashion tea.

00:03:44.106 --> 00:03:48.014
- I have the upper hand this time, master.

00:03:48.014 --> 00:03:49.361
- [Voiceover] Mercy is
a pretty key character

00:03:49.361 --> 00:03:51.044
in Genji's story.

00:03:51.044 --> 00:03:52.472
Genji is left on the brink of death

00:03:52.472 --> 00:03:54.481
following the violent
confrontation we mentioned

00:03:54.481 --> 00:03:56.024
between him and Hanzo.

00:03:56.024 --> 00:03:59.322
It was Dr. Angela Ziegler,
or Mercy, who rescues him

00:03:59.322 --> 00:04:01.040
from death on behalf of Overwatch.

00:04:01.040 --> 00:04:02.422
Even though the two of them
haven't worked together

00:04:02.422 --> 00:04:04.405
since those days, Mercy still has concern

00:04:04.405 --> 00:04:06.890
for her ex-patient's welfare,
as shown by this line.

00:04:06.890 --> 00:04:09.509
- You seem well, Genji.

00:04:09.509 --> 00:04:12.759
- I am a different man now. I am whole.

00:04:13.942 --> 00:04:15.707
- [Voiceover] And, although
Genji may have struggled

00:04:15.707 --> 00:04:18.899
with his cyborg form created
by Overwatch to save his life,

00:04:18.899 --> 00:04:20.676
he's still seemingly grateful to Mercy

00:04:20.676 --> 00:04:22.626
for what she's done for him, shown here.

00:04:22.626 --> 00:04:25.808
- You've rescued me again, Dr. Ziegler.

00:04:25.808 --> 00:04:26.923
- [Voiceover] And the
rest of the Overwatch cast

00:04:26.923 --> 00:04:29.196
of heroes and villains, Genji
has a few other interactions

00:04:29.196 --> 00:04:30.589
and we picked a few for you here.

00:04:30.589 --> 00:04:32.621
Firstly, with Genji and Winston.

00:04:32.621 --> 00:04:34.467
From the Overwatch animated short "Recall"

00:04:34.467 --> 00:04:36.093
and his voice lines, we know that Winston

00:04:36.093 --> 00:04:38.182
is a big Overwatch geek and loves the idea

00:04:38.182 --> 00:04:40.875
of Overwatch reforming and
working with his old team again.

00:04:40.875 --> 00:04:43.197
He's equally enthusiastic when
talking to Genji about this.

00:04:43.197 --> 00:04:46.298
- Genji, this is just like old times.

00:04:46.298 --> 00:04:50.465
- Our paths cross for now. As
to the future, we shall see.

00:04:53.531 --> 00:04:55.040
- [Voiceover] Genji's
interaction with Zarya

00:04:55.040 --> 00:04:56.358
is also quite interesting.

00:04:56.358 --> 00:04:58.709
Zarya has very strong
feelings against omnics.

00:04:58.709 --> 00:04:59.835
They're a big part of her character

00:04:59.835 --> 00:05:02.668
given her experience with
currently battling them in Syberia

00:05:02.668 --> 00:05:04.154
and also, them being one of the reasons

00:05:04.154 --> 00:05:05.698
that she had to give up her weightlifting

00:05:05.698 --> 00:05:07.695
and professional sports career.

00:05:07.695 --> 00:05:10.381
She's not immediately ready to
trust Genji, as we hear here.

00:05:10.381 --> 00:05:13.813
- How do I trust a man
who is half machine?

00:05:13.813 --> 00:05:17.368
- The heart of a man
still beats inside me.

00:05:17.368 --> 00:05:18.292
- [Voiceover] Of all the
characters in the world

00:05:18.292 --> 00:05:20.961
of Overwatch, it feels like
Genji has a huge grounding

00:05:20.961 --> 00:05:22.575
and an array of lines and interactions

00:05:22.575 --> 00:05:25.397
that trigger when he spawns
into certain maps and levels.

00:05:25.397 --> 00:05:27.568
He has lines with several
characters in many levels.

00:05:27.568 --> 00:05:29.495
Here's a selection of our favorites.

00:05:29.495 --> 00:05:32.316
The first place we'll start
is home, for Genji anyway.

00:05:32.316 --> 00:05:34.755
Hanamura is the home of the Shimada Clan,

00:05:34.755 --> 00:05:36.798
Genji and Hanzo's ancestral home.

00:05:36.798 --> 00:05:39.564
Genji enjoyed a life of luxury
and privileges as a child.

00:05:39.564 --> 00:05:41.825
As the clan master's youngest
son, he enjoyed a playboy

00:05:41.825 --> 00:05:43.891
and carefree lifestyle
in spite of excelling

00:05:43.891 --> 00:05:45.145
at his ninja training.

00:05:45.145 --> 00:05:46.968
We can discover a fraction
of how he spent his time

00:05:46.968 --> 00:05:48.326
in this line, when Genji spawns

00:05:48.326 --> 00:05:50.788
in the Hanamura attacking
spawn, "The Arcade."

00:05:50.788 --> 00:05:55.379
- [Genji] I pass many an hour
of my misspent youth here.

00:05:55.379 --> 00:05:56.212
- [Voiceover] And as part of the

00:05:56.212 --> 00:05:58.425
master and student relationship,
it's also interesting

00:05:58.425 --> 00:06:00.840
to see Zenyatta take interest
in Genji's upbringing.

00:06:00.840 --> 00:06:03.615
- [Zenyatta] So this is where you grew up.

00:06:03.615 --> 00:06:05.615
You must show me around.

00:06:06.669 --> 00:06:07.876
- [Voiceover] Another
part of the Over-verse

00:06:07.876 --> 00:06:10.221
that Genji has a deep
connection with is Nepal.

00:06:10.221 --> 00:06:11.452
It seems from looking at the map,

00:06:11.452 --> 00:06:13.600
that when he accepted
Zenyatta's mentorship

00:06:13.600 --> 00:06:14.946
after his period of wandering,

00:06:14.946 --> 00:06:17.970
Genji came here to spend
some time with the Shambali,

00:06:17.970 --> 00:06:20.624
the order of monks led by Mondatta.

00:06:20.624 --> 00:06:22.507
It feels as though amongst the omnics

00:06:22.507 --> 00:06:24.209
and the snowcap mountains, Genji managed

00:06:24.209 --> 00:06:26.299
to find some connection
with the world again.

00:06:26.299 --> 00:06:28.992
He has several lines on Nepal
that show his affinity, joy,

00:06:28.992 --> 00:06:31.493
and affection to be part of
the monastery and community.

00:06:31.493 --> 00:06:34.349
- [Genji] (sighs) Just setting foot here

00:06:34.349 --> 00:06:36.099
sets my soul at ease.

00:06:37.333 --> 00:06:40.083
Only here, do I not feel outcast.

00:06:43.103 --> 00:06:44.770
This is my home now.

00:06:45.831 --> 00:06:47.283
- [Voiceover] As for the
evidence that Genji was here,

00:06:47.283 --> 00:06:48.908
we'll save some for a Nepal map video,

00:06:48.908 --> 00:06:51.660
but we can see Genji's room
here in Nepal on stage one

00:06:51.660 --> 00:06:53.329
with a picture of the Shimadas,

00:06:53.329 --> 00:06:54.710
what perhaps was once his robe,

00:06:54.710 --> 00:06:56.823
and what could well be his sword.

00:06:56.823 --> 00:06:58.030
We found this line on his sword

00:06:58.030 --> 00:06:59.962
that we think actually triggers
when he goes into the room.

00:06:59.962 --> 00:07:04.049
- [Genji] This is my sword, Ryu Ichimonji.

00:07:04.049 --> 00:07:05.743
- [Voiceover] Now, when trying
to work out this sword name,

00:07:05.743 --> 00:07:07.264
apparently "Ryu" means "dragon"

00:07:07.264 --> 00:07:10.051
and "ichimonji" something
like "figure one,"

00:07:10.051 --> 00:07:12.355
a fighting stance, and it
could also refer to the shape

00:07:12.355 --> 00:07:13.774
of a katana blade being similar

00:07:13.774 --> 00:07:15.742
to the Japanese way of
writing, the number "one."

00:07:15.742 --> 00:07:17.866
Ichimonji is used in
a bunch of sword names

00:07:17.866 --> 00:07:20.235
in the English translation
in some games already.

00:07:20.235 --> 00:07:21.802
Any ideas on that? Please let us know.

00:07:21.802 --> 00:07:24.426
Thanks a bunch for the help on that one.

00:07:24.426 --> 00:07:26.690
As part man and part
machine, Genji, of course,

00:07:26.690 --> 00:07:28.478
has a natural interest
in the fate of omnics

00:07:28.478 --> 00:07:30.359
out in the Overwatch world.

00:07:30.359 --> 00:07:32.425
King's Row is currently
the scene of great tension

00:07:32.425 --> 00:07:34.840
between omnics and humans
and Genji is certainly aware

00:07:34.840 --> 00:07:36.895
of this in this interaction with Zenyatta.

00:07:36.895 --> 00:07:38.852
- [Genji] Does the
suffering of the omnics here

00:07:38.852 --> 00:07:40.197
trouble you, master?

00:07:40.197 --> 00:07:41.567
- [Zenyatta] It does.

00:07:41.567 --> 00:07:45.832
My brother, Mondatta, gave
much to improve their lives,

00:07:45.832 --> 00:07:48.077
but it was not to be.

00:07:48.077 --> 00:07:48.924
- [Voiceover] We know, of course,

00:07:48.924 --> 00:07:51.188
that Mondatta paid the
ultimate price with his life,

00:07:51.188 --> 00:07:53.223
as seen by the events
of the "Alive" short,

00:07:53.223 --> 00:07:55.310
where Widowmaker assassinates him in spite

00:07:55.310 --> 00:07:57.109
of Tracer's best efforts.

00:07:57.109 --> 00:07:58.595
Memorials to Mondatta in King's Row

00:07:58.595 --> 00:08:00.093
are physical there still.

00:08:00.093 --> 00:08:02.843
However, with escalating tension
between the people there,

00:08:02.843 --> 00:08:04.063
whether his memory and teachings

00:08:04.063 --> 00:08:07.175
will help diffuse the
crisis remain to be seen.

00:08:07.175 --> 00:08:09.288
Even though Genji's found
some peace with his existence,

00:08:09.288 --> 00:08:11.799
he still feels out of place on occasion.

00:08:11.799 --> 00:08:14.304
In Numbani, a city where
humans and omnics are meant

00:08:14.304 --> 00:08:16.599
to be coexisting happily
together for quite some time,

00:08:16.599 --> 00:08:19.333
he's still not quite at ease,
as we can see from this line.

00:08:19.333 --> 00:08:22.535
- [Genji] Even here, I feel an outcast.

00:08:22.535 --> 00:08:24.092
- [Voiceover] Regardless
of any struggles though,

00:08:24.092 --> 00:08:26.470
Genji has certainly found a
new appreciation of beauty

00:08:26.470 --> 00:08:27.991
and life on his travels.

00:08:27.991 --> 00:08:29.292
He can now see beauty in places

00:08:29.292 --> 00:08:31.789
that he hasn't even seen
before, as shown by this line,

00:08:31.789 --> 00:08:33.866
when he revisits Watchpoint: Gibraltar.

00:08:33.866 --> 00:08:36.038
- [Genji] It is beautiful here.

00:08:36.038 --> 00:08:39.230
I could never appreciate it before.

00:08:39.230 --> 00:08:40.063
- [Voiceover] Thanks
very much for tuning in

00:08:40.063 --> 00:08:42.370
to my Hero Voice Lines and Story series.

00:08:42.370 --> 00:08:44.181
If you like this video, please
hit that "like" button below

